{"id":"180fc7511460425a","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-measure9-ergodic-join.md","title":"ZFC Measure9 Ergodic Join","display":"df-zfc-measure9-ergodic-join — ZFC Measure9 Ergodic Join","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure9-ergodic-join","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure9-ergodic-join"],"display":"df-zfc-measure9-ergodic-join — ZFC Measure9 Ergodic Join","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-joining.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure9-ergodic-join"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure9-ergodic-join</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure9-ergodic-join — ZFC Measure9 Ergodic Join"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"11a66aa01f6e941d\" href=\"?note=11a66aa01f6e941d\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md\">../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4a3373ca17fc93e6\" href=\"?note=4a3373ca17fc93e6\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-joining.md\">../batch06/58-df-joining.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a8bb827e3e31f34f\" href=\"?note=a8bb827e3e31f34f\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y\\in V\">\\(\\lambda,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X=\\langle X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,T\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal X=\\langle X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,T\\rangle\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Y=\\langle Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu,S\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal Y=\\langle Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu,S\\rangle\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,T,Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu,S,\\mathcal H,U\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,T,Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu,S,\\mathcal H,U\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Joining}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Joining}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4a3373ca17fc93e6\" href=\"?note=4a3373ca17fc93e6\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-joining.md\">../batch06/58-df-joining.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ErgodicModNull}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ErgodicModNull}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"11a66aa01f6e941d\" href=\"?note=11a66aa01f6e941d\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md\">../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (product sigma algebra and typed function predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9ErgodicJoin}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9ErgodicJoin}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}ergodic\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9ErgodicJoin}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal X=\\langle X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,T\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal Y=\\langle Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu,S\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal H,U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Joining}\\bigl(\\lambda;(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,T),(Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu,S)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U,X\\times Y,X\\times Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;\n\\bigl(U(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=\\langle T(x),S(y)\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{ErgodicModNull}_S(U,\\lambda,X\\times Y,\\mathcal H)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}ergodic\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9ErgodicJoin}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal X=\\langle X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,T\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal Y=\\langle Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu,S\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal H,U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Joining}\\bigl(\\lambda;(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,T),(Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu,S)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U,X\\times Y,X\\times Y)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;\n\\bigl(U(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=\\langle T(x),S(y)\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{ErgodicModNull}_S(U,\\lambda,X\\times Y,\\mathcal H)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The product sigma algebra and product transformation are explicit witnesses shared by the joining data and the ergodicity test; the undeclared abbreviations <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\otimes\\mathcal G\">\\(\\mathcal F\\otimes\\mathcal G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\times S\">\\(T\\times S\\)</span> are eliminated.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md","status":"resolved","id":"11a66aa01f6e941d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-joining.md","status":"resolved","id":"4a3373ca17fc93e6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-joining.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a8bb827e3e31f34f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-joining.md","status":"resolved","id":"4a3373ca17fc93e6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Joining}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch06/58-df-joining.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md","status":"resolved","id":"11a66aa01f6e941d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ErgodicModNull}_S\\subseteq V^4$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\lambda,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal X=\\langle X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,T\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal Y=\\langle Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu,S\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,T,Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu,S,\\mathcal H,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Joining}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ErgodicModNull}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9ErgodicJoin}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}ergodic\\text{-}join}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9ErgodicJoin}_S(\\lambda,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal Y)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathcal X=\\langle X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,T\\rangle\n\\land\\mathcal Y=\\langle Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu,S\\rangle\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists\\mathcal H,U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Joining}\\bigl(\\lambda;(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,T),(Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu,S)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(U,X\\times Y,X\\times Y)\\\\\n&\\qquad{}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;\n\\bigl(U(\\langle x,y\\rangle)=\\langle T(x),S(y)\\rangle\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{ErgodicModNull}_S(U,\\lambda,X\\times Y,\\mathcal H)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal F\\otimes\\mathcal G","display":false},{"tex":"T\\times S","display":false}],"bytes":2058,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2670","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-zfc-measure9-ergodic-join.md|58-df-zfc-measure9-ergodic-join]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","11a66aa01f6e941d","4a3373ca17fc93e6","a8bb827e3e31f34f","36d7463d215be751"]}